<title>USA: Environment One Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>Environment One Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>NISKAYUNA, N.Y. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three Months Ended March 31, 1997 and 1996</p>
<p>					   Three Months Ended March 31,</p>
<p>							 1997	   1996</p>
<p> Revenue				     $4,547,725     3,945,236</p>
<p>Costs and Expenses</p>
<p>   Cost of Sales			    2,934,433     2,866,375</p>
<p>   Selling and Marketing		    601,876	 529,357</p>
<p>   General and Administrative	     738,377	 362,202</p>
<p>   Interest Expense			    41,984	  62,723</p>
<p>   Other Expense (Income)		   (2,489)     (177,964)</p>
<p> Total Expenses, Net			4,314,181     3,642,693</p>
<p> Net Earnings Before Taxes		  233,544	 302,543</p>
<p> Income Tax Expense			    88,600	 113,700</p>
<p> Net Earnings				   144,944	 188,843</p>
<p>Per Share Amounts:</p>
<p> Basic Earnings per Common Share	     0.03	    0.05</p>
<p> Diluted Earnings per Common Share	   0.03	    0.04</p>
<p>Memo: (Basic Earnings per Common Share)</p>
<p> Net Earnings-Operational		   144,944	  79,489</p>
<p> Net Earnings-Sale of IFD Business			  109,354</p>
<p> EPS-Operational				   0.03	    0.02</p>
<p> EPS-Sale of IFD Business					  0.03</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Environment One Corp.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
